  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards strengthened local communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall Impact of Project / Programme: To foster resilient and self-sufficient communities in northwest Syria where children are protected and have improved access to education and wellbeing through support to community led initiatives.  Outcome: A community working collaboratively towards the shared goal of enhancing and responding to the education and child protection needs of children in affected areas by earthquake fostering a sense of unity and shared responsibility.</narrative>
  </description>
