  <sector code="16015" percentage="100" vocabulary="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1: Restored and functioning affected education and child protection spaces affected by the earthquake that offer safe and inclusive learning and play environments contributing to a substantial increase in school attendance and wellbeing of children.Output 2: child protection and youth committees that are capacitated to identify, design, and implement in-door and out-door community initiatives for affected spaces by earthquake effectively with active participation from the community members.</narrative>
